{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"aee5f457e878920e4a34f197ac584dab705ffb56d58fa0c71d8cc80c1dc33b58","ja":"キャンペーンは続く？","zh":"活动还会继续吗？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"27a7543d235e83db303e1b2cac3c2e7f3692b94ee35d864b40937fce46e2c710","ja":"「あの、765プロのみなさんですよね！\n私、STARDOM ROAD公演を見てファンになって！」","zh":"“请问，各位是765事务所的人吧！\n我看了STARDOM ROAD的公演之后，就成了粉丝！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f6cf2d7d32c5e1f89c3559031153592431a5c2a0d5fb2a38409eeffa1916867c","ja":"サンキューな！\nすっげー嬉しいよ！","zh":"谢啦！\n超开心的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"978505a80551cbf7702c56d7d4c7d87e28f0ffe5dbc8c0700b981833d7f00e40","ja":"「紗代子さん、藍さんみたいに厳しい人なのかなって\n少し怖かったんですけど……本当は優しいんですね！」","zh":"「我还稍微有点害怕，\n担心纱代子小姐会不会是像蓝小姐那样严厉的人……其实很温柔呢！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f27d6bc3578a9898b22704c7e85af20e86d7d976155b5d727c61c27466dc8c29","ja":"あっ、いえ、そんな……。\nこれからも応援、よろしくお願いします！","zh":"啊，没、没那回事……\n今后也请多多支持！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b118e6f357f7e4b976124e4d4acb8cfd37c009a3e80b6e3e6ccfde2478beaff8","ja":"やったな、紗代子！\n怖くないって、分かってもらえたみたいだぜ！","zh":"太棒了，纱代子！\n看来大家已经明白你并不可怕了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b88048a350a5da14d2d88e36ccf3a2828b0359d9a7ec649e8c3bdedb93be0a01","ja":"す、昴ちゃんが考えた、『紗代子さんはいい人\nキャンペーン』の効果だね……えへへっ♪","zh":"这、这是小昴想出来的“纱代子是个好人\n大宣传”的效果呢……嘿嘿♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"83895d446411a9090af45d2bc340c42ca3aae2ddb7324cb43d2f18dcabee2ede","ja":"ありがとう。恥かしい思いもしちゃったけど、\n怖がられなくなって、良かったな♪","zh":"谢谢你。虽然也觉得挺不好意思的，\n不过大家不再害怕我了，真好呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"1d29f165533b705868cfd13415bb4d2595ccc76de316f9bc5e7bd8e90ca4c954","ja":"でも、まだまだこれからですよ～！　紗代子ちゃんの\nいいところは、これくらいじゃありませんからねっ！","zh":"不过，接下来才是重头戏哦～！\n纱代子的优点，可远远不止这些呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b8ddce37fff63f27721b8baff4af029e93ff17048546709414a2e638c830d85d","ja":"ふふっ、そうですわね。わたくしもまだ言っていない、\n紗代子のエピソードが……。","zh":"呵呵，确实如此呢。我也有还没说过的、\n关于纱代子的趣事呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"6506de48f990363c94672b8cbc901d48195f696dbd3aca297ac210272a41765d","ja":"も、もう大丈夫ですからっ……！","zh":"已、已经没事了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"6c0e15f198957351e67745a3df48baf031c573695b8267fd2572b2581e92034e","ja":"それより、私が役のイメージで\n怖がられちゃったってことは……。","zh":"比起那个，我因为角色的印象\n而被别人害怕的话……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"50abed616e20790817ebe91e0303ff7ddd867a565bb1b1ac401974567a6e482d","ja":"これから藍役をする人も、\nそうなっちゃうのかな？","zh":"之后饰演蓝的人，\n也会变成那样吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"6934966e770f9ebf47815988a09884843087e696b9bb6ae2febc0bf795d10ca6","ja":"あっ……そ、そうかもしれませんね……。","zh":"啊……也、也许是这样呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"1f9c61ffaad3f63abe6858c4a0f7fdca7c8606c34ae13a44940e0074a3564408","ja":"そのたびに、良い人キャンペーンをしてもいいけど、\nちょっと大変そうだよな……そうだ！","zh":"虽然每次都展开“好人行动”倒也未尝不可，\n不过感觉会有点累人啊……有了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"63dc4edc1ae7b137a8c51b9c3704243be90bd35fa24ee0fb529e4a891fe53b69","ja":"『藍はホントはいい奴なんだキャンペーン』を\nすればいいんだよ！","zh":"只要办个\n“其实蓝是个好人活动”就行啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"6a6008bd884afdbaa23f9c2bd70b5e921eaf91456d788d1964d639359eda20c2","ja":"それならこの先、誰が藍役をやったって……。","zh":"既然如此，今后不管谁来演蓝……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1450.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"46a4989b049ee5f404a2d2b345722b2de28d229a10330bdf7069356500f9a9ed","ja":"だ、ダメだよ！　そんなことしたら、\nお芝居の内容に影響でちゃうからっ！","zh":"不、不行啦！要是那么做的话，\n会影响到演出内容的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
